  "summary": "PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nSoftware and Embedded Systems Engineer with a B.S. in Computer Science and a systems-level approach to building reliable software and connected devices. Combines software development, API/data validation, automated testing, and debugging with embedded firmware, board-level integration, sensor interfaces, and Edge AI interests. Focuses on tracing issues across software, hardware, and data boundaries, designing testable interfaces, and documenting repeatable verification procedures\n\nTECHNICAL SKILLS\n- Software Engineering: Python, SQL, Java, JavaScript, TypeScript, REST APIs, object-oriented design, data structures, modular architecture, API integration, input/schema validation, exception handling, logging, debugging, root-cause analysis \n\n- Testing DevOps: pytest, unit/integration/regression testing, test-case design, boundary and negative testing, Git/GitHub, CI/CD, Docker, Linux, build and release workflows, reproducible defect reports, technical documentation\n\n- Data AI: pandas, NumPy, scikit-learn, PyTorch, TensorFlow, Hugging Face, data cleaning, feature preparation, embeddings, vector search, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), LLM evaluation\n\n- Embedded Systems: Embedded C/C++, firmware architecture, interrupts and ISRs, timers/counters, PWM, ADC/DAC, GPIO, UART, SPI, I²C, CAN, USB, Ethernet, DMA, watchdogs, boot/startup, memory constraints, low-power design, RTOS concepts, JTAG/SWD debugging \n\n- Hardware–Software Integration: Sensor/actuator interfacing, register-level configuration, peripheral drivers, board bring-up, hardware abstraction layers (HAL), device communication protocols, timing analysis, fault handling, firmware logging, interface validation, system integration testing \n\n- Edge AI, Radar DSP: NVIDIA Jetson / Jetson Orin NX, model deployment concepts, inference pipeline integration, sensor-data preprocessing, raw ADC/IQ data, FFT, range/Doppler processing concepts, FMCW radar concepts, target classification, FPGA/Vivado workflows \n\n- PCB, RF Verification: Altium Designer, KiCad, Cadence, SPICE, HFSS, CST, schematic capture, PCB layout, RF simulation, oscilloscope, VNA, logic analyzer, power-supply/current measurement, EMI/EMC qualification and troubleshooting",
